OL,4,BMorocco and Senegal await Afcon final  
OL,5,Bverdict after court case               
OL,6,GEveryone knows a football match should 
OL,7,Gtake 90 minutes, but the final of the  
OL,8,G2025 Africa Cup of Nations has been    
OL,9,Gplaying out for 10 months.             
OL,11,FNow, finally, Morocco or Senegal will  
OL,12,Fbe crowned winners. However, that      
OL,13,Fmoment of glory will come in a         
OL,14,Fcourtroom, not on the pitch.           
